## What is new in this work

- The data-derived action space: grid point-tracking → 200-D per-chunk
  displacement → PCA egomotion basis (`preprocessing/fit_pca_basis.py`), with the
  frozen basis in `preprocessing/checkpoints/pca_basis.pt`.
- Action conditioning of the causal backbone via AdaLN-zero and action tokens
  (`model/action_modulation.py`, `model/action_model_patch.py`).
- The latent egomotion critic and its generator guidance
  (`model/action_critic.py`, plus the critic/guidance logic in
  `trainer/causal_diffusion_teacher_train.py`).
- Teacher-forced multi-chunk decomposition and the chunk-at-a-time
  autoregressive rollout (`utils/causal_chain_rollout.py`,
  `model/causal_teacher_streaming.py`).
- The cross-model evaluation protocol and its metrics
  (`evaluation/inject_eval.py`, `evaluation/ndof_following.py`,
  `evaluation/headtohead_extract.py`, and the instruments in
  `evaluation/quality/`).

